    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Create and sell your unique succulent bonsai.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can grow a complete succulent using succulent leaves. When the succulent is in the state of flower sword, it is possible to generate a new variety of succulents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/a5aec78fd1845c255e3de1503d455196.poster.avif?t=1751010329\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/a5aec78fd1845c255e3de1503d455196.webm?t=1751010329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/a5aec78fd1845c255e3de1503d455196.mp4?t=1751010329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use flower pots, succulents and ornaments to create your personalized bonsai. There are a wealth of materials to match here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/19474a5a5e6b34622a7fc52f4a9f3722.poster.avif?t=1751010329\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/19474a5a5e6b34622a7fc52f4a9f3722.webm?t=1751010329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/19474a5a5e6b34622a7fc52f4a9f3722.mp4?t=1751010329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Listen to every customer's story and pack and send them the most suitable succulent bonsai.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/544c6c14f01bf982502a6319c0b800c1.poster.avif?t=1751010329\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/544c6c14f01bf982502a6319c0b800c1.webm?t=1751010329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/544c6c14f01bf982502a6319c0b800c1.mp4?t=1751010329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also keep the beautiful succulent bonsai and put it on the display stand for your own appreciation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/dad11bd1ab36ffb41dcef9e9af132000.poster.avif?t=1751010329\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/dad11bd1ab36ffb41dcef9e9af132000.webm?t=1751010329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/dad11bd1ab36ffb41dcef9e9af132000.mp4?t=1751010329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game has no big goals and no winning or losing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The probability of items appearing is relatively high, so there will not be too much pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just calm down and feel the joy of creation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you like simple planting and creation, give it a try (Add to your wishlist !)</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Create and sell your unique succulent bonsai.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can grow a complete succulent using succulent leaves. When the succulent is in the state of flower sword, it is possible to generate a new variety of succulents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/a5aec78fd1845c255e3de1503d455196.poster.avif?t=1751010329\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/a5aec78fd1845c255e3de1503d455196.webm?t=1751010329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/a5aec78fd1845c255e3de1503d455196.mp4?t=1751010329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use flower pots, succulents and ornaments to create your personalized bonsai. There are a wealth of materials to match here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/19474a5a5e6b34622a7fc52f4a9f3722.poster.avif?t=1751010329\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/19474a5a5e6b34622a7fc52f4a9f3722.webm?t=1751010329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/19474a5a5e6b34622a7fc52f4a9f3722.mp4?t=1751010329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Listen to every customer's story and pack and send them the most suitable succulent bonsai.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/544c6c14f01bf982502a6319c0b800c1.poster.avif?t=1751010329\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/544c6c14f01bf982502a6319c0b800c1.webm?t=1751010329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/544c6c14f01bf982502a6319c0b800c1.mp4?t=1751010329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also keep the beautiful succulent bonsai and put it on the display stand for your own appreciation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/dad11bd1ab36ffb41dcef9e9af132000.poster.avif?t=1751010329\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/dad11bd1ab36ffb41dcef9e9af132000.webm?t=1751010329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664520/extras/dad11bd1ab36ffb41dcef9e9af132000.mp4?t=1751010329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game has no big goals and no winning or losing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The probability of items appearing is relatively high, so there will not be too much pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just calm down and feel the joy of creation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you like simple planting and creation, give it a try (Add to your wishlist !)</p>",
